<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States recently struck Iran's Qeshm Island and disabled a commercial vessel attempting to run a blockade in the Gulf of Oman, while Iran launched a missile that hit a building in Tel Aviv. Iran continues to use the Strait of Hormuz as leverage in the regional confrontation. The United States has offered a $20 million reward for information on Iran's nuclear program, and France warned of a response to a cyberattack on supermarkets blamed on Iran. The conflict has already caused 123 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/10/trump-vows-to-back-pete-hegseth-as-republican-lawmaker-pushes-impeachment-vote&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/09/world/europe/ukraine-russia-peace-talks.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/10/attacks-escalate-between-saudi-led-forces-and-yemens-iran-backed-houthis?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/09/world/europe/france-iran-refrigerators-cyberattack.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/08/climate/what-is-cop31-climate.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/10/us-petrol-prices-are-down-but-elevated-inflation-continues?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/10/iran-backs-nuclear-treaty-even-as-hardliners-raise-prospect-of-bomb?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/6e4100c2-a69e-4f42-a99d-64c056d8592d?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/1